BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//kylinyu//domain-transfer-reminder//ZH-TW
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kylinyu-win-transfer-start-2027@kylinyu.win
DTSTAMP:20260617T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270419
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270420
SUMMARY:🔓 開始把 kylinyu.win 從 Gandi 轉到 Cloudflare
DESCRIPTION:到期日 2027-06-10。提前作業：\n1) Gandi 解除鎖定 (移除 clientTransferProhibited)\n2) 取得授權碼 EPP/Auth code\n3) Cloudflare Dashboard → Domain Registration → Transfer Domains 貼碼付款 (~$5)\n轉移會自動 +1 年。詳見 repo docs/domain-migration.md
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:開始 kylinyu.win 轉移到 Cloudflare
TRIGGER:-PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kylinyu-win-transfer-backstop-2027@kylinyu.win
DTSTAMP:20260617T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270517
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270518
SUMMARY:⚠️ kylinyu.win 還沒轉好?最後檢查 (到期 6/10)
DESCRIPTION:若轉移尚未完成，今天務必處理或先在 Gandi 續費避免再次 clientHold 斷線。到期日 2027-06-10。
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:kylinyu.win 轉移最後檢查
TRIGGER:-PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kylinyu-win-expiry-2027@kylinyu.win
DTSTAMP:20260617T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270610
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270611
SUMMARY:📅 kylinyu.win 網域到期日
DESCRIPTION:此日到期。理想情況此時已轉到 Cloudflare 並開啟 auto-renew。
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:kylinyu.win 到期日
TRIGGER:-PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
